# Restart Nebulae, on the configsettings page of the instr selector.
# A .ui entry is not run as a program: Nebulae itself handles it (ui.py,
# mode = the name after the number, here "restart_nebulae").
# Speed click on it: the instrument is saved (knob values, encoder pages, the
# engine's own values over OSC) and Nebulae restarts with the same
# instrument. For an instrument that has jammed. Also on the settings web
# page (Restart), which restarts Nebulae even when it does not answer.
